  injected into a Local /system/bin/sh by LocalCliBootstrap). The same-UID UDS
  bridge server (atcli_env native lib) binds in the host's private files dir.

  No permissions declared here: the host app declares what it needs. The bridge
  is private (same-UID SO_PEERCRED auth), never on public TCP, never 0.0.0.0.
